  "body": "To download the documents for this property, copy and paste the following link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/8X21\r\n\r\nSeize this rare opportunity to secure a 616 sqm, freehold blank canvas in one of Red Beach's most sought-after streets. Just 280 metres' walk to the golden sands of Red Beach and the local surf club, this centrally located section offers the perfect setting to create your dream beachside home.\r\n\r\nWith shops, public transport, and schooling - including zoning for highly regarded Red Beach School - right on your doorstep, convenience blends seamlessly with lifestyle. Enjoy easy access to the scenic coastal walkways connecting you to nearby Orewa, with its vibrant cafes, restaurants, and community atmosphere.\r\n\r\nWhether you're planning your forever home or a weekend retreat, this location promises a relaxed, coastal lifestyle with everything you need within reach.",
